      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/contents/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2024-09-26-17-55-34.gh-issue-116510.dhn8w8.rst?ref=17a336412dd96ab29e2ceaa8049eede468b9b06e",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Fix a bug that can cause a crash when sub-interpreters use \"basic\"\n+single-phase extension modules.  Shared objects could refer to PyGC_Head\n+nodes that had been freed as part of interpreter cleanup."
    },
    {
      "sha": "b79d4b5332ea8312aafce64fabeddccf03040fcb",
      "filename": "Python/gc.c",
